### Context Blocks

#### dispatches methods to context object

- Verify: dispatches methods to context object


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 11 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: dispatches methods to context object")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
class Calculator:
    fn double(self, x):
        return x * 2

val calc = Calculator {}
var res = 0
context calc:
    res = double(21)
expect res == 42
```

</details>

