#### passes arguments to method_missing

- Verify: passes arguments to method_missing


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 11 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: passes arguments to method_missing")
class Multiplier:
    factor: i64 = 10

    fn method_missing(self, name, args, block):
        val x = args[0]
        return self.factor * x

val m = Multiplier { factor: 7 }
expect m.any_method(6) == 42
```

</details>

